<title>UK: LIFFE WHITE SUGAR END LITTLE CHANGED, TRADE LIGHT.</title>
<headline>LIFFE WHITE SUGAR END LITTLE CHANGED, TRADE LIGHT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE white sugar futures closed slightly lower on Tuesday after responding belatedly to an initially weak performance in New York, traders said.</p>
<p>Front month Oct recorded only 598 lots traded and edged lower by $0.90 to $322.00 and Dec was down $1.40 at $319.50 having traded 342 lots.</p>
<p>The Paris Oct contract was also a shade lower, losing $0.40 to $321.90 but Dec was $1.20 firmer at $321.00.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
